m-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"item.ssd12-q09\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q09</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">9. Die Sorgen um meine Gesundheit rauben mir Energie.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"item.ssd12-q10\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q10</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">10. Ich denke, dass die Ärzte meine körperlichen Beschwerden nicht ernst nehmen.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarc