archy xhtCellBorder1\"/></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-q01\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q01</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">1. Ich denke, dass meine körperlichen Beschwerden Anzeichen einer ernsthaften Erkrankung sind.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-q02\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q02</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">2. Ich mache mir große Sorgen um meine Gesundheit.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-q03\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q03</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">3. Meine gesundheitlichen Sorgen behindern mich im Alltag.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-q04\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q04</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">4. Ich bin von der Ernsthaftigkeit meiner körperlichen Beschwerden überzeugt.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-q05\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q05</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">5. Meine körperlichen Beschwerden machen mir Angst.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-q06\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q06</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">6. Meine körperlichen Beschwerden beschäftigen mich den größten Teil des Tages.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-q07\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q07</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">7. Andere sagen mir, dass meine körperlichen Beschwerden nicht schlimm sind.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-q08\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q08</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">8. Ich mache mir Sorgen, dass meine körperlichen Beschwerden niemals aufhören werden.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-q09\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q09</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">9. Die Sorgen um meine Gesundheit rauben mir Energie.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-q10\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q10</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">10. Ich denke, dass die Ärzte meine körperlichen Beschwerden nicht ernst nehmen.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-q11\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q11</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">11. Ich mache mir Sorgen auch in Zukunft durch meine körperlichen Beschwerden beeinträchtigt zu bleiben.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-q12\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-coding.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"coding\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-q12</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">12. Durch meine körperlichen Beschwerden kann ich mich schlecht auf andere Dinge konzentrieren.</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-coding\">coding</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Value Set: <a href=\"ValueSet-mii-vs-pro-ssd-12-answers.html\">MII VS PRO SSD-12 Answers</a></td></tr>\r\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck00.png)\" id=\"de-item.ssd12-score-total\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon-q-decimal.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"decimal\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> ssd12-score-total</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Score. SSD-12 Summenwert (0-48)</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-item-type.html#item-type-decimal\">decimal</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\"><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/questionnaire-definitions.html#Questionnaire.item.readOnly\" title=\"Is Read Only\"><img src=\"icon-qi-readonly.png\" alt=\"\"/></a><img src=\"icon-qi-readonly.png\" alt=\"\"/></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder1\">Question Code: <a href=\"CodeSystem-mii-cs-pro-score-catalogue.html\" title=\"https://www.medizininformatik-initiative.de/fhir/ext/modul-pro/CodeSystem/mii-cs-pro-score-catalogue\">MII CS PRO Score Catalogue</a>#ssd-12-total &quot;SSD-12 Total Score (0-48)&quot;</td></tr>\r\n<tr><td co